S2. The grok seat reported on `#518`'s pass 2 that STAT0 (+0x040), STAT1 (+0x060), SFT_RST (+0x0c0) and
    PAR_DIS (+0x0e0) are documented registers (HRM around `:10461`, `:10496`), that S6.4.14 items 1-2
