12679:                                         1 8000 0140  The parity disable bit is cleared
12680: IOC_W_MASK0  Window mask 0              1 8000 0160  to enable parity checking and
12681: IOC_W_MASK1  Window mask 1              1 8000 0180  reporting after reset.
